<h1 class="email-heading">Profile Update</h1>

<p class="email-text">
  Hey <strong>{{newProfile.name}}</strong>, the address associated with your
  account is now listed as:
</p>

<p class="email-text">
  <strong>
    {{newProfile.street}}, {{newProfile.city}}
    <br />
    {{newProfile.state}}, {{newProfile.zipcode}}
  </strong>
</p>

<p class="email-text">
  Your phone number is <strong>{{newProfile.phone}}</strong>.
</p>

<p class="email-text">
  This change was made by <strong>{{admin.name}}</strong>.
</p>

{{> button href=loginUrl label="Update Your Profile"}}

<p class="email-text">
  If this information is not correct, sign in and update your profile.
</p>
